# ticked-line — шаги записи (что показывается — ticked-line.md)
# Его замечание 2026-10-05: Mark/Dim ticked line — отдельно от Separators. Default Obsidian — галочка только ставится.
# Strike through не показан: Obsidian и так зачёркивает отмеченный текст, на кадре разницы почти нет.
title Ticked line | Ticking a box can add a tag and fade the line
open Ticked line.md
caret - [ ] book a table
stage Default Obsidian
say Obsidian: ticking the box only checks it
cmd editor:toggle-checklist-status
expect - [x] book a table

stage Mark ticked line
say Mark ticked line → #done
settings Tags & PKM
set Mark ticked line = #done
caret - [ ] book a table
say Tick → #done is added; untick → it goes
cmd editor:toggle-checklist-status
expect - [x] #done || book a table
cmd editor:toggle-checklist-status
expect - [ ] book a table / - [ ] call the bank
cmd editor:toggle-checklist-status

stage Dim ticked line
say Dim ticked line → on
settings Tags & PKM
set Dim ticked line = on
caret - [ ] call the bank
say Tick → the line fades
cmd editor:toggle-checklist-status
expect - [x] #done || call the bank

